t push\n\nSeparately, reformat _pages/about.md to satisfy the prettier CI gate, which\nhas been red since c9fa884 over a double space and a trailing space.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019B8V2U7fAKknG7CVknZNDj","tree":{"sha":"09aa5b0eeb3bace472a787df1bfff22e576152bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saleese/saleese.github.io/git/trees/09aa5b0eeb3bace472a787df1bfff22e576152bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saleese/saleese.github.io/git/commits/8d85dec7dd0bfb7a1a4ab100e568e33461566f2e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saleese/saleese.github.io/commits/8d85dec7dd0bfb7a1a4ab100e568e33461566f2e","html_url":"https://github.com/saleese/saleese.github.io/commit/8d85dec7dd0bfb7a1a4ab100e568e33461566f2e","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saleese/saleese.github.io/commits/8d85dec7dd0bfb7a1a4ab100e568e33461566f2e/comments","author":{"login":"saleese-gnu","id":80230270,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMjMwMjcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80230270?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saleese-gnu","html_url":"https://github.com/saleese-gnu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saleese-gnu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saleese-gnu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saleese-gnu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saleese-gnu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saleese-gnu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saleese-gnu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saleese-gnu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saleese-gnu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saleese-gnu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"pu